abstract: >-
  A reproducible multisource database that harmonizes oncology drugs, drug
  synonyms, regimens, regimen synonyms, condition-regimen associations, and
  clinical-trial intervention names. The release includes 11 production CSV
  tables, implementation code, source and release manifests, RxNorm mapping
  audits, and quality-assurance reports.
